msgid_plural ""
"Renting a private room for `{days}` days costs {coin}**{required}**, but you"
" only have {coin}**{balance}**!"
msgstr[0] ""
"Η ενοικίαση ιδιωτικού δωματίου για `1` ημέρα κοστίζει {coin}**{required}**, "
